    "body": "In the tool I'm developing I use the serial number to recognize the boards, when I put the board in bootloader mode, the com port, name, etc may change but not the serial number, so it's mandatory to keep it. Although I'm not using webusb yet to access boards, as I wait for it to be a at more stable state. The tool I'm developing is Node Blue, the demo is here : http://www.nodeblue.org/gui/\r\nEven if it won't expose boards in the demo version, maybe it will help you understand the purpose.",
